flowchart TD
    Q[Question] --> V[Validate]
    V --> E[Query embedding]
    E --> S[FAISS normalized inner product]
    S --> F[Ready IDs and selected-document filter]
    F --> K[Threshold and top-k]
    K --> P[Quarantine suspicious passages and bound context]
    P --> H{Evidence exists?}
    H -->|No| N[Low-relevance response]
    H -->|Yes| L[Gemini structured output]
    L --> C{Answerable and all citations valid?}
    C -->|No| A[Information not available]
    C -->|Yes| O[Answer with verified source identities]
    N --> D[(Audit transaction)]
    A --> D
    O --> D
